        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: University of Florida, University of Texas System\n- Places: Gainesville, Florida, Austin, Texas\n- Concepts: public land-grant universities, sea-grant universities, space-grant universities, research universities, university systems\n\nFacts:\n- The University of Florida is an American public land-grant, sea-grant, and space-grant research university.\n- The University of Florida is commonly referred to as Florida or UF.\n- The University of Florida is located on a 2,000-acre campus in Gainesville, Florida.\n- The University of Texas System is headquartered in Austin, Texas.\n- The University of Texas System has a total enrollment of more than 216,000 students.\n- The University of Texas System is the largest university system in Texas.\n- The University of Texas System employs more than 87,000 faculty and staff.",
